    <h1>FreshBooks Review 2026: Honest Pros, Cons, and Pricing for Freelancers</h1>
    <p class="lede">If you've ever spent a Sunday evening manually chasing a late invoice, FreshBooks was built for you. We tested it against six alternatives on ease of use, automation, pricing, and time tracking. Here's what we found.</p>
