    </div>
    <p class="verdict-text">FreshBooks has the cleanest invoicing interface in the category, time tracking built into every plan, and automation that genuinely saves hours every month. The one catch: the cheapest plan limits you to 5 billable clients. If that fits your situation, it is hard to beat.</p>
    <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Try FreshBooks free — 30-day trial [AFFILIATE LINK]</a>
