    <p class="section-label">Who should use it and who should skip it</p>
    <div class="decision-grid">
      <div class="decision-card">
        <p class="decision-q">Use FreshBooks if you...</p>
        <p class="decision-a">Invoice clients for time or projects, have up to 50 active clients, bill by the hour, or found QuickBooks too complex for a one-person business.</p>
